//   * The old Job & Family Services page on medinaco.org is gone; the county's
//     current JFS page is listed.
//   * OhioMeansJobs and Main Street Medina moved to Business & Economy.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Medina NY/WA/TN/TX; Brunswick GA/ME/MD; Wadsworth IL/NV; Lodi CA/NJ; Seville;
//   Westfield NJ/MA; Buckeye Local and Highland Local also exist in other Ohio
//   counties; mcooa.org (the old Office for Older Adults site) now serves betting
//   spam; medina-fair.com no longer loads.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cities: Medina (the seat), Brunswick and Wadsworth (Rittman is mainly Wayne
//     County). Villages with sites: Chippewa Lake, Lodi, Seville, Spencer and
//     Westfield Center; Gloria Glens Park's site was last updated in 2017.
//   * Seven school districts (Black River's office is in Ashland County), the Medina
//     County ESC and Career Center, and Tri-C's Brunswick University Center.
//   * Cleveland Clinic Medina and Lodi hospitals; Summa Wadsworth-Rittman; the
//     Medina County Mental Health & Recovery Board.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Several township sites (Lafayette, Litchfield, Liverpool, Medina, Montville,
//     Spencer, Wadsworth, Westfield, York): research hit a page-fetch limit.
//   * The Port Authority, Historical Society, domestic violence shelter, Wadsworth
//     chamber and Rotary clubs: no site found or not reached.

